      "searchText": "2160p quality 2160p quality utilizes the encode efficiency index https dictionarry dev wiki eei metric at a 55 target ratio to prioritize transparent x265 4k encodes 4 quality tiers prioritize encodes from reputable groups with fallback to high quality web dls and balanced tier groups 2 additional quality tiers are placed below for further fallback special considerations for both hdr and lossless audio formats help to push lower tiered encodes over higher tier ones in cases where better sources are used if no 2160p release can be found the profile will fall back to the 1080p quality profile quality profile",
